#: ../../api/palm_tracer.PALMTracer.rst:2
msgid "PALMTracer"
msgstr ""

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer:1
msgid "Orchestre un traitement PALM complet et conserve ses données intermédiaires et finales."
msgstr "Orchestrates a complete PALM workflow and retains its intermediate and final data."

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer:3
msgid "La classe coordonne la configuration, les appels à la DLL PALM, le pipeline de traitement, le filtrage, la production des visualisations et la sauvegarde des résultats."
msgstr "The class coordinates configuration, calls to the PALM DLL, the processing pipeline, filtering, visualization generation, and result saving."

#: ../../api/palm_tracer.PALMTracer.rst:9
msgid "Attributs"
msgstr "Attributes"

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.settings:1
msgid "Classe principale des paramètres PALMTracer."
msgstr "Main class for PALMTracer settings."

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.palm:1
msgid "Interface vers la DLL C++ Palm."
msgstr "Interface to the Palm C++ DLL."

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.filtering:1
msgid "Outil de filtrage."
msgstr "Filtering tool."

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.df:1
msgid "Résultats des différents calculs."
msgstr "Results of various calculations."

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.KEYS_TO_FILE:1
msgid "Alias entre les noms de fichiers et les clés dans le dictionnaire de DataFrames."
msgstr "Aliases between filenames and keys in the dataframe dictionary."

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.localizations:1
msgid "Getter du :class:`DataFrame <pandas.DataFrame>` de la localisation (filtrée si elle est non vide)."
msgstr "Getter for the :class:`DataFrame <pandas.DataFrame>` of the localization (filtered if it is not empty)."

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.beads:1
msgid "Getter du :class:`DataFrame <pandas.DataFrame>` des billes détectées."
msgstr "Getter for the :class:`DataFrame <pandas.DataFrame>` of detected beads."

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.tracks:1
msgid "Getter du :class:`DataFrame <pandas.DataFrame>` du suivi (filtré s'il est non vide) et reconnecté s'il est non vide également."
msgstr "Getter for the :class:`DataFrame <pandas.DataFrame>` of the tracking (filtered if it is not empty) and reconnected if it is also not empty."

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.tracks_compute:1
msgid "Getter du trio de :class:`DataFrame <pandas.DataFrame>` des calculs sur trajectoires (filtrées si le tableau est non vide)."
msgstr "Gets the trio of :class:`DataFrame <pandas.DataFrame>` for tracks compute (filtered if the array is non-empty)."

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.path:1
msgid "Dossier de sortie pour le fichier en cours de traitement."
msgstr "Output directory for the file currently being processed."

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.stack:1
msgid "Pile en cours de traitement."
msgstr "Stack currently being processed."

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.suffix:1
msgid "Suffixe des fichiers pour un traitement (timestamp au format ``YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS``)."
msgstr "File suffix for processing (timestamp in `YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS` format)."

