#: ../../api/palm_tracer.PALMTracer.rst:34
msgid "Accesseurs"
msgstr "Accessors"

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.get_localization_key:1
msgid "Clé des localisations (filtrées si le tableau est non vide) et corrigées si le tableau est non vide également."
msgstr "Key for localizations (filtered if the array is non-empty) and corrected if the array is also non-empty."

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.get_tracks_key:1
msgid "Clé des trajectoires (filtrées si le tableau est non vide) et reconnectées si le tableau est non vide également."
msgstr "Key for tracks (filtered if the array is non-empty) and reconnected if the array is also non-empty."

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.get_tracks_compute_key:1
msgid "Clé des calculs sur trajectoires (filtrées si le tableau est non vide)."
msgstr "Key for track computes (filtered if the array is non-empty)."

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.get_status:1
msgid "Retourne un dictionnaire décrivant le statut des tableaux actuellement chargés dans ``self._df`` pour les différentes catégories de données (Localisations, Trajectoires, MSD, Diffusion instantanée, Fit)."
msgstr "Returns a dictionary describing the status of the arrays currently loaded in ``self._df`` for the different data categories (Localizations, Tracks, MSD, Instantaneous Diffusion, Fit)."

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.get_status:4
msgid "Cette méthode analyse chaque tableau pour savoir s'il correspond :"
msgstr "This method analyzes each array to determine whether it corresponds to:"

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.get_status:5
msgid "à un tableau standard,"
msgstr "a standard array,"

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.get_status:6
msgid "à un tableau filtré,"
msgstr "a filtered array,"

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.get_status:7
msgid "à un tableau reconnecté (pour les trajectoires),"
msgstr "a reconnected array (for tracks),"

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.get_status:8
msgid "à un tableau corrigé (pour les localisations),"
msgstr "a corrected array (for localizations),"

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.get_status:9
msgid "ou à une absence de données."
msgstr "or a lack of data."

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.get_status:11
msgid "Les statuts retournés sont des chaînes de caractères provenant de la constante globale :data:`FILE_STATUS`."
msgstr "The returned statuses are strings derived from the global constant :data:`FILE_STATUS`."

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.get_status:13
msgid "Le dictionnaire retourné contient systématiquement les clés suivantes : ``Localization``, ``Beads``, ``Tracking``, ``MSD``, ``Instant D``, ``Fit``"
msgstr "The returned dictionary always contains the following keys: ``Localization``, ``Beads``, ``Tracking``, ``MSD``, ``Instant D``, ``Fit``"

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.get_status:16
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Un dictionnaire ``{str: str}`` contenant le statut de chaque type de tableau."
msgstr "A ``{str: str}`` dictionary containing the status for each array type."

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.output_viz_name:1
msgid "Indique le nom du fichier de visualisation à enregistrer CHEMIN / name-Timestamp.extension."
msgstr "Specify the name of the visualization file to be saved: PATH / name-Timestamp.extension."

#: of palm_tracer.PALMTracer.PALMTracer.output_viz_name:3
msgid "Nom du fichier."
msgstr "File name."

